"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:98ed535a-269e-42a9-a488-e57976729319\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:98ed535a-269e-42a9-a488-e57976729319\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Effect\"> Effect </span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"> <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a> </span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Consume the potion to grant yourself <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bottled_Breath_(Condition)\" title=\"Bottled Breath (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/POT_Potion_of_Feather_Fall_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-POT_Potion_of_Feather_Fall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/POT_Potion_of_Feather_Fall_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-POT_Potion_of_Feather_Fall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/POT_Potion_of_Feather_Fall_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-POT_Potion_of_Feather_Fall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bottled Breath\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/POT_Potion_of_Feather_Fall_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-POT_Potion_of_Feather_Fall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7a/POT_Potion_of_Feather_Fall_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bottled_Breath_(Condition)\" title=\"Bottled Breath (Condition)\">Bottled Breath</a></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Bottled_Breath\"> Condition: Bottled Breath </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bottled_Breath_(Condition)\" title=\"Bottled Breath (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/POT_Potion_of_Feather_Fall_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Feather_Fall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/POT_Potion_of_Feather_Fall_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-POT_Potion_of_Feather_Fall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/POT_Potion_of_Feather_Fall_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-POT_Potion_of_Feather_Fall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bottled Breath\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/POT_Potion_of_Feather_Fall_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Feather_Fall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7a/POT_Potion_of_Feather_Fall_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bottled_Breath_(Condition)\" title=\"Bottled Breath (Condition)\">Bottled Breath</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Until <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected Entity is able to cast <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gust_of_Wind\" title=\"Gust of Wind\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/58/Gust_of_Wind_Icon.webp/25px-Gust_of_Wind_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/58/Gust_of_Wind_Icon.webp/38px-Gust_of_Wind_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/58/Gust_of_Wind_Icon.webp/50px-Gust_of_Wind_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gust of Wind\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/58/Gust_of_Wind_Icon.webp/25px-Gust_of_Wind_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/58/Gust_of_Wind_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gust_of_Wind\" title=\"Gust of Wind\">Gust of Wind</a> once per long rest.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>        <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Despite what the tooltip states, drinking this potion allows casting <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gust_of_Wind\" title=\"Gust of Wind\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/58/Gust_of_Wind_Icon.webp/20px-Gust_of_Wind_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/58/Gust_of_Wind_Icon.webp/30px-Gust_of_Wind_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/58/Gust_of_Wind_Icon.webp/40px-Gust_of_Wind_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gust of Wind\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/58/Gust_of_Wind_Icon.webp/20px-Gust_of_Wind_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/58/Gust_of_Wind_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gust_of_Wind\" title=\"Gust of Wind\">Gust of Wind</a> an unlimited number of times per Long Rest.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 446.66666666667px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 444.66666666667px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Konstantin-melnik-cons-f.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Render by Konstantin Melnik\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Konstantin-melnik-cons-f.jpg/667px-Konstantin-melnik-cons-f.jpg.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Konstantin-melnik-cons-f.jpg/1001px-Konstantin-melnik-cons-f.jpg.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Konstantin-melnik-cons-f.jpg/1334px-Konstantin-melnik-cons-f.jpg.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Render by Konstantin Melnik\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Konstantin-melnik-cons-f.jpg/667px-Konstantin-melnik-cons-f.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"445\" height=\"250\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Konstantin-melnik-cons-f.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Render by Konstantin Melnik</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203505\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.088 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.092 seconds\nPreproce